  - musteriIsmi: "Zafk\u0131 E\u015Fci"
    cinsiyet: 1
    yas: 30
    loreHikayesi: "\xD6nceki g\xF6revlinin a\u015F\u0131k oldu\u011Fu kad\u0131n"
    sevilenTurler: 010000000000000005000000
    sevmedigiTurler: 
    sabirCarpani: 1
    odemeCarpani: 1
    incelemeSuresiCarpani: 1
    meslek: 
    ozelDiyaloglar:
    - "Onu... onu tan\u0131rd\u0131m. \u0130yi biriydi."
    - "Babam gibi a\u015F\xE7\u0131 olaca\u011F\u0131m demi\u015Ftim ona bir keresinde.
      G\xFClm\xFC\u015Ft\xFC."
    - "Onu son g\xF6rd\xFC\u011F\xFCmde s\u0131radan bir g\xFCnd\xFC. Hi\xE7bir \u015Fey
      hissetmedim. \u015Eimdi hep d\xFC\u015F\xFCn\xFCyorum bunu."
    - "Bir tarif kitab\u0131 alaca\u011F\u0131m, ama bug\xFCn pi\u015Firecek g\xFCc\xFCm
      yok galiba."
    - "Yeni bir tarif kitab\u0131 var m\u0131? Kafam\u0131 da\u011F\u0131tmam laz\u0131m."
    - "Onun Gemici olaca\u011F\u0131n\u0131 san\u0131p babas\u0131n\u0131n gemisinde
      i\u015Fe girmi\u015Ftim.\nAma \xF6ld\xFC\u011F\xFCn\xFC duyunca ayr\u0131ld\u0131m"
